msgid "Set custom notification sounds for specific contacts"
msgstr "Set ba sons ya notification personnalisée pona ba contacts spécifiques"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:338
msgid "Set custom ringtones for specific contacts"
msgstr "Set ba sonneries personnalisées pona ba contacts spécifiques"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:363
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Code ya Mboka ya Par défaut esalelamaka pona ko formater ba nombres oyo "
"ezali na préfixe international te (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"Soki batiki yango mpamba, système elukaka koyeba yango yango moko na karte "
"SIM to na réseau na yo.\n"
"\n"
"Okoki ko superposer yango manuellement awa na kokotisa code ya région ISO ya "
"2 lettres (e.g. US, FI, DE) to code ya kobenga (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:384
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"Tone ya ringback ezali son oyo ebetami (toot-toot-toot) tango ozali kozela "
"ete appel oyo ekobima eyanola. Ba transporteurs misusu ba générer yango te "
"donc toza na option ya ko générer yango manuellement awa. \n"
"\n"
"Okoki kopona fisyé ya miziki na yo moko, to kolongola yango mpo na kosalela "
"ton ya système standard."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:404
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "Pona Tone ya kozonga"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:412
msgid "Audio Files"
msgstr "Ba Fichiers ya Audio"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:438
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"Pona ba livres d’adresse oyo okosalela na Telephone mpe bongisa yango na "
"ordre ya priorité. Buku ya baadrɛsi oyo ezali likoló mpenza nde ezali na "
"esika ya liboso mpe ekolinga mingi soki motángo moko ezwami na babuku ya "
"baadrɛsi mingi. Okoki kosalela toggle ya Resolver ya ba doublons oyo ezali "
"awa na se mpo na kosalisa na kotambwisa ba doublons, kasi ata soki ekangami, "
"tolendisi ko activer yango mpo na expérience ya malamu."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:457
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Ntango efungolami, soki nimero moko ya telefone ebengi yo mbala 3 na boumeli "
"ya miniti 5, kobenga ya misato (mpe oyo elandi na kati ya lininisa) ekotinda "
"telefone ebeta na volume maximale, koleka mode Silent to Do Not Disturb."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:469
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"Pona ba contacts oyo ekobeta tango nionso ba notifications na volume "
"mobimba, ata soki téléphone ezali na mode Silent to Do Not Disturb."

